澄又逼求姨女為妾姨不與澄詣建康令沈徽孚訟之徽孚曰姨女可為婦不可為妾澄曰僕父為給事中門戶既盛姨家猶是寒賤政可為妾耳徽孚訶而遣之十一年為皇太孫妃又有女巫子楊珉之亦有美貌妃尤愛之與同寢處如伉儷及太孫即帝位為皇后封后嫡母劉為高昌縣都鄉君所生母宋為餘杭廣昌鄉君后將拜鏡在牀無因墮地其冬與太后同日謁太廟楊珉之為帝所幸常居中侍明帝為輔與王晏徐孝嗣王廣之並面請不聽又令蕭諶坦之固請皇后與帝同席坐流涕覆面謂坦之曰楊郎好年少無罪過何可枉殺坦之耳語於帝曰此事別有一意不可令人聞帝謂皇后為阿奴曰阿奴蹔去坦之乃曰外間並云楊珉之與皇后有異情彰聞遐邇帝不得已乃為敕坦之馳報明帝即令建康行刑而果有赦原之而珉之已死","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"澄","person_id":"cbe_2j4_a10","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段及兩書互見紀傳繫人。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:u0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"人家女","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"此女子未名。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:m0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"南郡王","person_id":"iop_ybd_afm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段及兩書互見紀傳繫人。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:u0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"姨女","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"馬澄姨母之女。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:u0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"姨","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"馬澄姨母。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:m0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"沈徽孚","person_id":"4cd_j3u_56v","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段及兩書互見紀傳繫人。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:u0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"父","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"馬澄引父官為詞，未載姓名。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:m0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"女巫","person_id":"mj9_tz2_mtq","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段及兩書互見紀傳繫人。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-hejingying-izumo:p003:m0105","start":105,"end":108,"surface":"楊珉之","person_id":"ur2_4yl_xwz","kind":"person","